msgstr "Si seulement je pouvais les attraper !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
