msgstr "Terre et mer, sans la terre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH3_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.FISH3_COOKED"
