msgstr "Ça a l'air dangereux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER.DEAD"
