msgstr "Prends ça, décoration gratuite !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT"
