msgstr "Ça ressemble à... un genre de bateau..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LOTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LOTUS"
