msgstr "Quelle délicatesse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST"
