msgstr "J'aime le tranchant de cette lame."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL"
