msgstr "Je devine une opportunité en or."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS"
