msgstr "On raconte des choses bizarres sur cette plante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED"
