msgstr "La poisse, mec."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
