msgstr "Viens surfer avec moi !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
