msgstr "T'es tout beau, pourceau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
