msgstr "Waouh, t'es vraiment fidèle ! C'est admirable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
