msgstr "L'argent, ça sert aussi à acheter des siestes, en fait."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN.GENERIC"
