#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR.GENERIC"
