#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR.SLEEPING"
