#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING"
