msgstr "Une balise pour éclairer mon chemin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE"
