msgstr "Un peu de confort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP.ON"
