msgstr "Nourriture d'attaque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.GENERIC"
