#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP.SLEEPING"
