msgstr "Puisse sa quête de döuceurs pörter ses fruits."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_USHER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_USHER.SLEEPING"
