msgstr "Un temple en l'hönneur de Gullinbursti, pröbablement ?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ARTICHOKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ARTICHOKE"
