msgstr "Un endröit pöur de la lumière."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_SCEPTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_SCEPTER"
