msgstr "Le grand Lögi est proche !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_GENERAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_GENERAL.GENERIC"
