msgstr "Il dört incönsidérément."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE"
