msgstr "Ceci rend les cömbats möins amusants."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE"
