msgstr "Personne ne te pleurera, volaille."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN.GENERIC"
