msgstr "Un oiseau minable aux rêves minables."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA"
