msgstr "Un signe bienvenu de civilisation."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP.ON"
