msgstr "Elle est en flammes !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE.GENERIC"
