msgstr "Celui-ci est devenu sauvage."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.GENERIC"
