msgstr "Un monsieur distingué. Enfin, façon de parler."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER.SLEEPING"
