msgstr "Une femme comme je les aime."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE.SLEEPING"
