#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MECHANIC.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MECHANIC.SLEEPING"
