#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR_CRAFT"
