#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT"
