msgstr "Toutes les portes mènent à la mort."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK"
