msgstr "Tu sembles un peu trop agité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_CORPSE"
