msgstr "Une belle et noble activité."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWSKITTISH_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWSKITTISH_WATER"
