msgstr "Oh là là..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP"
