#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC"
