msgstr "Le trophée d'un meurtre excellent."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS"
