msgstr "Je suppose que ça vaut le coup de les garder."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT"
