msgstr "Usé, pour l'instant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC"
