msgstr "Il y en a partout sur l'île."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL"
