msgstr "Il est plein de petites graines."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED"
