msgstr "On a tout pris."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED"
