msgstr "Ce bruit n'augure rien de bon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
