msgstr "Oh, il y a un gros poisson pas loin."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL"
