msgstr "Elle marchera pas comme ça."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_CLAW"
