msgstr "Bon sang ! Je ne peux pas brûler ça !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_HEAD"
