msgstr "Je devrais mettre un coup de pied dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_RIBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_RIBS"
