msgstr "Ça sera pratique si je me fais empoisonner."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLER"
