msgstr "Un fichu bébé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTMASKHAT"
