msgstr "Il y a des choses que je peux voler dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTSUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTSUIT"
