msgstr "Ce chapeau est très moche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER.SLEEPING"
