msgstr "Bien au chaud dans ma poche."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
