msgstr "Il est trop duveteux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
