msgstr "Pas plus utile comme ça que liquide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
