#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "Is glowing yellow."
