msgstr "Ce serait bien la sortie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_EXIT2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_EXIT2"
