#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_PRODUCE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_PRODUCE.BURNING"
