msgstr "Beaucoup moins marrant maintenant."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC"
