msgstr "Belle coupe de feveux."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
