msgstr "Fa fervait à indiquer quelque fove."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
