msgstr "Fa fe tortille pas mal là-dedans."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
