msgstr "Hé ho ! Par ifi la beftiole !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
