msgstr "F'est mon fapeau porte-bonheur !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSSAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSSAIL"
