msgstr "F'est ma voile !"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE"
