msgstr "Leur trou femble vivre fes dernières v'heures."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
