msgstr "Cette longue-vue marche pas bien."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
